  ('52e55464-185f-5715-a3fd-01d43ccfa50e', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-authors-purpose'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Why does the author list the contents of the boxes before stating what they "do not contain"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The list of official papers sets up a sharp contrast that exposes a gap in the record, which is the problem her essay addresses.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The list of official papers explains how the telephone exchange was run, which is the main subject she wants readers to learn.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The list of official papers shows that she prefers documents to interviews, which she argues are less reliable sources.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-claim"},{"text":"The list of official papers proves that the boxes are well organized, which shows that the society needs no further projects.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The list of official papers sets up a sharp contrast that exposes a gap in the record, which is the problem her essay addresses.$q$, $q$After cataloging schedules, invoices, and a manual, she notes there is not "a single sentence written by an operator," revealing the missing voices she wants to preserve. She values interviews highly, so she does not prefer documents.$q$, 'draft', 'e333b01d-90fc-50c6-ae92-812d90d513e0')
