  ('4991dab2-d9f1-5863-8252-887571a85340', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-character-setting-plot'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What does Pemba's choice to leave her pups on the bank and test the water alone reveal about her?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She has forgotten Osei's advice and acts without any reason at all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She wants to prove that she is a stronger swimmer than any heron.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She trusts her own observation enough to check the advice before risking others.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She trusts Osei completely and crosses exactly as he told her to cross.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She trusts her own observation enough to check the advice before risking others.$q$, $q$Pemba hesitates because of what she sees in the water and tests the crossing herself, which protects the pups. She thanks Osei but does not follow his advice blindly, so complete trust is wrong.$q$, 'draft', '55ebc6fd-66db-5ce8-b1af-b853af85f1cf')
