   $q$Which action is described in both texts?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Harvesting plums from an orchard that has grown for many years.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Selling a dry farm and moving the family to a city in the east.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Planting young trees in a windswept field and watering them in the evening.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Building a stone wall along the field to block the blowing dust.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Planting young trees in a windswept field and watering them in the evening.$q$, $q$Nadia carries buckets to the saplings each evening, and the poem's speaker waters a twig "at evening." The plum trees in Text 1 have only a few leaves, so there is no harvest.$q$, 'draft', '10e9d0cb-9c22-509a-b6de-4a81b532ed66')
