  ('4c056d95-8e7c-5549-ba19-6e4ac2f2b155', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-connections'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How does the last sentence of the passage connect to the events described before it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It suggests that the committee planned every change in training and playing time before voting on the rule.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It argues that the rise in turnovers proved the coaches who opposed the shot clock were right all along.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"It shows that the rule mattered less than the new practice habits that coaches had adopted on their own.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-emphasis"},{"text":"It sums up a chain in which the rule changed games, which changed practice, which changed which players mattered.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It sums up a chain in which the rule changed games, which changed practice, which changed which players mattered.$q$, $q$The sentence links the rule to how games looked (paragraph 3), how teams trained (paragraph 3) and who earned playing time (paragraph 4), the same chain the passage traces. Turnovers returned to normal by the third season, so the opponents were only partly right.$q$, 'draft', 'da7fbf7e-ec2e-5cef-accb-14b15de0c7e3')
