   $q$The word "film" has several meanings. In "the film of rosin still clinging near the bridge," it means:$q$, $q$[{"text":"a thin coating on a surface","is_correct":true},{"text":"a deep crack in the wood","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unrelated-meaning"},{"text":"a movie shown in a theater","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"other-meaning-of-word"},{"text":"a roll of photographic material","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"other-meaning-of-word"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$a thin coating on a surface$q$, $q$The rosin is "still clinging" to the instrument after a quick wipe, so "film" here means a thin coating. The movie and photography meanings are real but make no sense on the surface of a violin.$q$, 'draft', '50aa5e60-24c7-592a-a197-dd2c65b9665e')
