values
  ('c36e32eb-b91b-5c6e-91bd-e88a3febf6b4', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-context-clues'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Coach Dagher is "even more sanguine" than Priya. Based on the context, "sanguine" means:$q$, $q$[{"text":"strict and demanding about mistakes","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"hopeful and positive about the outcome","is_correct":true},{"text":"red in the face from the cold","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"other-meaning-of-word"},{"text":"quiet and uninterested in results","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$hopeful and positive about the outcome$q$, $q$Priya has just reassured Tomasz, and the coach goes further, "smiling" and saying "You finished strong," so sanguine means hopeful and positive. The word can describe a reddish color, but the comparison with Priya's encouragement points to attitude, not appearance.$q$, 'draft', '546e9dff-3bc6-5849-9d93-5f92ab64d76e')
